<p>A <code>ganttTableHead</code> is one part of a
  <a href="/components/gantt-table/"><code>ganttTable</code></a>.
  It maps to the native HTML <code>&lt;thead&gt;</code>
  element. See the <a href="/components/gantt-table/">Gantt Table
  demo</a> for composed examples.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;GanttTable label="Q1 2025 schedule"&gt;
  &lt;GanttTableHead&gt;
    &lt;GanttTableTr&gt;
      &lt;GanttTableTH scope="col"&gt;Task&lt;/GanttTableTH&gt;
      &lt;GanttTableTH scope="col"&gt;Jan&lt;/GanttTableTH&gt;
      &lt;GanttTableTH scope="col"&gt;Feb&lt;/GanttTableTH&gt;
      &lt;GanttTableTH scope="col"&gt;Mar&lt;/GanttTableTH&gt;
    &lt;/GanttTableTr&gt;
  &lt;/GanttTableHead&gt;
  &lt;GanttTableBody&gt;...&lt;/GanttTableBody&gt;
&lt;/GanttTable&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
